 the cache size(s)\, and the specific features of that machine by looking a
 t the&nbsp\;</span><strong>cat /proc/cpuinfo</strong><span>&nbsp\;action f
 rom a run. You can determine your score by looking at the last&nbsp\;</spa
 n><strong>./Judge</strong><span> action.</span></p><script src="https://in
